# Per-package statement-coverage floors for `make cover`.
#
# Floors are set just below the measured value so they catch a real
# regression without failing on a one-line refactor. Raise a floor when a
# package improves; lower one only with a comment explaining why.
ALL                80
cmd/modbus-shield  57
internal/acl       92
internal/config    95
internal/mbtcp     88
internal/observ    77
internal/proxy     86
internal/watchdog  92
scripts/covercheck skip
